      "lines": [
        "д) $3x^2+2x-5=0$；　е) $5x^2+12x-10=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "854",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "854. 求下式的值：",
        "$\\frac{(y-x)^2}{x+y}\\div\\left(\\frac{2xy}{y^2-x^2}+\\frac{x}{x+y}-\\frac{y}{y-x}\\right)$",
        "设 $x=8.4$，$y=-0.6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "43. 用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们可以用图解法解二次方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2+6x+5=0$.　（1）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不用作图能不能解这个方程？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们由三项式 $x^2+6x+5$ 配出二项式的平方. 如果把 $x^2$",
        "这一项看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $6x$ 这一项看成第一项",
        "与第二项的积的两倍，那么由恒等式 $6x=2\\cdot x\\cdot3$ 可以明显",
        "地看出，二项式的第二项是 3. 把两个大小相等符号相反的",
        "数 $3^2$ 和 $-3^2$ 加到三项式里，得到："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2+6x+5=x^2+6x+3^2-3^2+5↵=(x^2+6x+9)-9+5=(x+3)^2-4$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程（1）和下列方程同解："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(x+3)^2-4=0$.　（2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把方程（2）的左边作为平方差分解因式，得到："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(x+3-2)(x+3+2)=0$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "就是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(x+1)(x+5)=0$.　（3）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程（3）的根的集合，也就是和它同解的方程（1）根的集"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
